CLRU  │  99.4 / 100.0 / 100.0              │  0.6 │  0.0
MGLRU │  38.0 /  99.6 / 100.0              │ 62.0 │ 12.3 - erratic and unstable
FG    │  99.9 / 100.0 / 100.0              │  0.1 │  0.0 - matches CLRU

      │ active_anon % min/med/max │ span │ stdev
CLRU  │   0.0 /   1.1 /  24.9     │ 24.8 │  4.5
MGLRU │   3.7 /  96.4 / 100.0     │ 96.3 │ 23.7 * chaotic, almost random
FG    │   0.0 /   0.9 /  12.3     │ 12.2 │  1.9 - matches CLRU

      │ active_file % min/med/max │ span │ stdev
CLRU  │  34.1 / 43.8 / 52.2      │ 18.1 │  4.7
MGLRU │   0.0 /  0.1 /  0.1      │  0.1 │  0.0 * useless, always ~0
